      "title": "GEHC Advances Omni 128 cm Total Body PET/CT Toward U.S. Market Entry",
      "summary": "GE HealthCare Technologies announced that its Omni 128 cm total body PET/CT system has entered FDA 510(k) review following CE Mark approval in November 2025. The system enables up to 88% reduction in PET dose or 86% reduction in scan time, imaging from head to thigh in a single position. The company also submitted its Omni 64 cm configuration for FDA review, offering up to 73% shorter scan times. The global PET scanners market is projected to reach $2.96 billion by 2026 with a 5% CAGR through 2034.",
